sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Pessoa as 🧑 Pessoa demandante
    participant SPA as 💻 Angular SPA
    participant Estado as ComplaintService (signals)
    participant API as ComplaintApiClient
    participant BFF as 🛡️ Express BFF
    participant Limite as RateLimiter / Redis
    participant Upload as UploadMiddleware / temp
    participant Domain as ComplaintDomainService
    participant Scanner as ClamAvClient / ClamAV
    participant MPT as MptApiClient / API MPT
    Pessoa->>+SPA: Confirma envio após revisão
    SPA->>+Estado: submitComplaint()
    Estado->>+API: submitComplaint(complaint)
    API->>API: buildFormData(campos + anexos)
    API->>+BFF: POST /api/denuncias (multipart/form-data)
    BFF->>+Limite: consume(ip)
    alt limite excedido
        Limite-->>-BFF: false
        BFF-->>API: 429 Too Many Requests
    else permitido
        Limite-->>BFF: true
        BFF->>+Upload: upload.any() (Multer diskStorage)
        Upload-->>-BFF: body + files temporários
        BFF->>BFF: JSON.parse(denuncia)
        BFF->>+Domain: validateComplaint(complaint)
        Domain-->>-BFF: erros[] ou []
        alt entrada inválida
            BFF-->>API: 400 / 413 / 422 + detalhes
        else entrada válida
            BFF->>+Scanner: scanUploadedFiles(files)
            loop para cada anexo
                Scanner->>Scanner: INSTREAM (TCP 3310)
            end
            Scanner-->>-BFF: ScanResult[] (clean · threat · unavailable)
            alt ameaça detectada
                BFF-->>API: 422 anexo rejeitado
            else scanner indisponível em produção
                BFF-->>API: 503 tente mais tarde
            else anexos liberados
                BFF->>Domain: generateProtocol()
                Domain-->>BFF: protocolo
                BFF->>Domain: buildComplaintPayload(complaint, protocolo, timestamp)
                Domain-->>BFF: MptEnvelope
                BFF->>+MPT: POST multipart + Bearer + timeout
                alt MPT aceita
                    MPT-->>-BFF: 200/201
                    BFF-->>API: 201 + protocolo
                    API-->>-Estado: protocol
                    Estado-->>-SPA: isSubmitted=true · protocol
                    SPA-->>-Pessoa: exibe protocolo
                else falha ou timeout
                    MPT-->>BFF: erro ou timeout
                    BFF-->>API: 502 / 503
                    API-->>Estado: Error
                    Estado-->>SPA: submissionError
                    SPA-->>Pessoa: exibe erro
                end
            end
        end
        Note over BFF,Upload: finally · cleanupUploadedFiles() sempre executa
        BFF->>Upload: cleanupUploadedFiles(files)
    end
